FILE,LAD 2
SOR,0 BST,1 XIC,I:1/0 NXB,1 XIC,O:2/1 BND,1 XIC,I:1/1 OTE,O:2/1 EOR,0
RCM,Run: Start seals in, Stop (NC) breaks it.
SOR,1 XIC,O:2/1 LES,I:7,6553 OTL,B3:0/0 EOR,1
RCM,Below 40 % (6553 of 16383): pump on.
SOR,2 GRT,I:7,9830 OTU,B3:0/0 EOR,2
RCM,Above 60 %: pump off. Between the two the pump keeps its state (hysteresis).
SOR,3 XIO,O:2/1 OTU,B3:0/0 EOR,3
RCM,Stopped: pump off.
SOR,4 XIC,O:2/1 XIC,B3:0/0 OTE,O:2/0 EOR,4
RCM,
SOR,5 XIC,I:1/2 OTE,O:2/2 EOR,5
RCM,High alarm follows the high level switch.
SOR,6 END,6
RCM,
SYMBOLS
I:1/0 Start
I:1/1 Stop (NC)
I:1/2 High level switch
I:7 Level 0-16383
O:2/0 Pump
O:2/1 Run
O:2/2 High alarm
B3:0/0 Pump demand
